{"title":"비에 젖은 흔적들이다","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=bTSlQn/dJMcacP0c2B/fciKwIFHDsbwgBS1NRgfEk&filename=th3","synopsis":"그날 내가 잃어버린 것은\n너일까, 나일까.\n\n그리고\n내가 다시 찾은 것은\n나일까, 너일까.\n\n아니면\n우리일까.\n\n14년 전 그날 홀로 남겨진 동경은\n갈 길을 잃은 채 그 자리에 멈춰버렸다.\n\n차가운 세상에 대한 믿음도 유대도 기대도 없다.\n절망도 없다.\n나조차도 없다.\n\n껍데기만 어른이 되어버린 동경은\n어느 날 전혀 모르는 세계에 떨어져 버린다.\n아름다운 나라 ‘가국’\n그리고 나와 너와, 너.\n\n미치지 않으려고 그렇게 애를 썼는데\n결국 미쳐버린 건가?\n\n내가 도착한 이곳이 \n가(佳)국인지 가(假)국인지 모르겠지만\n그래도 좋다.\n\n잃어버렸던 너를 다시 만나서.\n잃어버린 우리의 내일을 찾을 수 있어서.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":214,"change":{"type":"down","amount":30}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":210,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":115,"change":{"type":"up","amount":95}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":59,"change":{"type":"up","amount":56}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":117,"change":{"type":"down","amount":58}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":159,"change":{"type":"down","amount":42}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":209,"change":{"type":"down","amount":50}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":214,"change":{"type":"down","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":233,"change":{"type":"down","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":124,"change":{"type":"up","amount":109}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":75,"change":{"type":"up","amount":49}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":123,"change":{"type":"down","amount":48}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":172,"change":{"type":"down","amount":49}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":217,"change":{"type":"down","amount":45}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":235,"change":{"type":"down","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":257,"change":{"type":"down","amount":22}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":137,"change":{"type":"up","amount":120}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":38,"change":{"type":"up","amount":99}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":65,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":113,"change":{"type":"down","amount":48}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":151,"change":{"type":"down